      "title": "Resolve + classify",
      "items": [
        "work resolves the reference by path (the id)",
        "validate classifies the ref before local reads or initialization",
        "A remote ref is rejected before auto-init; only a non-remote absent ref is promoted"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "The gate is mandatory",
      "items": [
        "validate classifies the ref first; a remote ref is rejected before local reads",
        "After non-remote init or existing-folder resolution, validate reads task.yaml",
        "Both errors AND warnings block work -- fix forward, no recovery",
        "A Remote task (tmp + host mismatch) cannot be worked locally"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Emit instructions + agent action",
      "items": [
        "Only after passing does work emit the task's initialization instructions",
